  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-9iOOA6ei\" id=\"link-0\">概念介绍</h2><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-AUadPSTb\" id=\"link-1\">建站管理</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-AjRYfBDT\">在这个功能模块下，用户可以实现对落地页的管理（主要是增、删、改、查），其中包括橙子建站落地页管理、程序化落地页管理、第三方落地页管理三个功能模块。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-4M0PfUhJ\">创建生成的橙子建站落地页、第三方落地页可以在<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710530107404\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">营销投放</a>流程中使用。</p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-hMlMWVZ0\" id=\"link-2\">建站</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-fCkAaYfL\">即创建站点，站点是指存放落地页的地方。</p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-clXUgcSa\" id=\"link-3\">落地页</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-HPk2mJjT\">即创建营销时的创意详情页，也曾命名为应用下载详情页，用户点击营销中诸如“立即下载”此类文案的按钮以外的区域时所到达的页面，是创建营销创意时必不可少的重要环节。</p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-FZY9TcPI\" id=\"link-4\">落地页种类</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-aXfiUTmV\">橙子建站落地页：指客户通过橙子建站工具创建的落地页； 程序化落地页：又称落地页优选组，由多个单落地页打包形成的落地页组。投放时，根据流量分配设置在多个落地页之前进行营销流量分配； 第三方落地页：指客户自有的落地页。</p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-1nIf1fgi\" id=\"link-5\">功能预览</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-T52sp8aV\">以下展示当前支持的各类落地页相关功能，具体介绍请参考各模块及接口业务介绍。</p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-M94hQiUG\" id=\"link-6\">橙子建站落地页管理</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-VdSYo4DV\">橙子建站落地页创建完成后会生成建站ID，可以通过<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710620579852\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取橙子建站站点列表</a>接口获取建站ID。建站地址可由如下格式拼装得到：<a href=\"https://www.chengzijianzhan.com/tetris/page/XXXXXXXXXXXXX/（其中XX是建站ID，拼装后就可获得在广告投放流程中使用的投放的URL，以及预览URL）。建站地址可以用于广告投放。\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://www.chengzijianzhan.com/tetris/page/XXXXXXXXXXXXX/（其中XX是建站ID，拼装后就可获得在营销投放流程中使用的投放的URL，以及预览URL）。建站地址可以用于营销投放。</span></a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-2aDugqHG\">橙子建站总体功能介绍： <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710617140236\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">-橙子建站落地页管理</a> 各接口文档： <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710617712640\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">-创建橙子建站站点</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710618300431\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">-修改橙子建站站点</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710618884096\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">-更改橙子建站站点状态</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710619437056\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">-获取橙子建站站点预览地址</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710620022799\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">-获取橙子建站站点详细信息</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710620579852\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">-获取橙子建站站点列表</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710621120524\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">-建站工具——查询已有智能电话</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710621705216\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">-建站工具——查询已有表单列表</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710622245903\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">-建站工具——查询表单详情</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710622810127\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">-获取落地页预约表单信息</a></p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-b43elHmM\" id=\"link-7\">程序化落地页管理</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-e1rmlE3m\">程序化落地页总体功能介绍： <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710627940367\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">- 程序化落地页管理</a> 各接口文档： <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710628472844\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">- 创建落地页组</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710629043212\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">- 获取落地页组</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710629600256\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">- 更新落地页组站点状态</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710630182912\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">- 更新落地页组信息</a></p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-g72b925k\" id=\"link-8\">第三方落地页管理</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-Qc3MuNMa\">第三方落地页总体功能介绍： <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710624430095\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">- 第三方落地页管理</a> 各接口文档： <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710624992256\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">- 获取第三方落地页站点列表</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710625533967\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">- 创建第三方落地页站点</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710626095116\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">- 修改第三方落地页站点</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710626717696\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">- 删除第三方落地页站点</a> <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710627256332\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">- 获取第三方落地页预览地址</a></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-CRkHe5nk\" id=\"link-9\">相关问题Q&amp;A</h2><hr style=\"background-color: rgb(232, 232, 232); border: 1px solid transparent; margin: 18px 0px;\"/><p data-id=\"p838747a-LhHWn7o9\">Q：橙子落地页、程序化落地页、第三方落地页有什么区别和联系？</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-b0KnNQYo\">A：就落地页本身而言，橙子建站落地页和第三方落地页都属于自定义落地页，区别在于是通过橙子建站创建还是客户自主上传的； 而程序化落地页是多个单张落地页打包的落地页组。就营销投放而言，橙子建站落地页、第三方落地页都是客户自主选择进行手动投放的，而程序化落地页是根据流量分配设置在多个落地页之间进行营销流量分配，再进行投放的。</p></div>",
